      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/South_Fork,_Colorado",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "South Fork was incorporated in 1992, making it one of Colorado’s newest statutory towns and the youngest in the state.",
